Fira Code Nerd Font is Fira Code patched with Nerd Fonts icons and
symbols. This package installs the upstream TrueType fonts in Regular,
Light, Medium, Retina, SemiBold, and Bold styles.

Nerd Font, Mono, and Propo variants are included. Choose FiraCode Nerd
Font Mono for single-cell icons in a terminal.

The package version follows the Nerd Fonts release. No font patching
is needed. Installation and removal refresh font caches; restart any
applications that do not pick up font changes automatically.
